        {
          "text": " Cwiny Maleŋ kacel ki nyako ger gitye ka wacci, “Bin!” Ŋat ma owinyo lok man bene myero ogam ni, “Bin!” Ŋat ma orwo neko myero obin, wek ŋat ma mito bene omat pii me kwo laboŋo wel.",
