              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok bene ka ce ŋat mo okwanyo lok mo woko ki i kom lok ma gitito i buk kany, Lubaŋa bene bikwanyo twerone me camo yat me kwo ki donyo i gaŋ maleŋ woko, ma gicoyo pigi i buk kany-nyi.",
          "type": "text",
